{
  "taskId": "cpp.u1.s1.stranger-transfer.v1",
  "taskFamily": "cpp.steps.v1",
  "kind": "STRANGER",
  "title": "体育课报数（综合）",
  "prompt": [
    {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "text": "换到体育课：全班从 1 到 60 报数，逢 3 的倍数就拍手一次。程序要输出两行：拍手总次数、最后一次拍手的编号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "text": "卡里已经有循环、判断和两个记录变量，但条件不对，而且「记下最后一次编号」那一步还没有写。"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "text": "先口算猜两个数（记录不判分），再把程序补对。"
    }
  ],
  "givens": {
    "inputs": {
      "n": 60
    },
    "program": [
      {
        "kind": "ASSIGN",
        "var": "clapCount",
        "expr": "0"
      },
      {
        "kind": "ASSIGN",
        "var": "lastClap",
        "expr": "0"
      },
      {
        "kind": "FOR",
        "var": "i",
        "from": "1",
        "bound": "n",
        "cmp": "<=",
        "body": [
          {
            "kind": "IF",
            "cond": "i % 3 == 3",
            "then": [
              {
                "kind": "ASSIGN",
                "var": "clapCount",
                "expr": "clapCount + 1"
              }
            ],
            "else": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "OUTPUT",
        "expr": "clapCount"
      },
      {
        "kind": "OUTPUT",
        "expr": "lastClap"
      }
    ],
    "cursorStep": 0
  },
  "givenLocks": [],
  "responseSchemaId": "resp.cpp.u1.program.v1",
  "allowedOperationIds": [
    "EditStepProgram",
    "SetTraceCursor"
  ],
  "operationConstraints": [
    {
      "type": "StepProgram",
      "editableSlots": [
